44:14.815 --> 44:25.740
[SPEAKER_01]: We use the new MJ 32 grams on the top and the bottom is with the Porsche light. And also inside we have some hybrid between Porsche hard normal

44:25.920 --> 44:37.285
[SPEAKER_01]: and the Porsche 32 grams. It was hard work optimizing the perforation in every rip, in every cell, not cell, in every diagonal rip to make really

44:37.365 --> 44:46.911
